msgstr "在 Kodi 设置中启用 Web 服务器服务，以允许艺术图缓存。"

msgctxt "#33104"
msgid "Find more info in the github wiki/Create-and-restore-from-backup."
msgstr "更多信息请访问 github wiki/Create-and-restore-from-backup。"

msgctxt "#33105"
msgid "Enable the context menu"
msgstr "启用上下文菜单"

msgctxt "#33106"
